{"id":"NCT07195656","title":"Evaluation of a Non-Implanted Electrical Stimulation Device for Overactive Bladder (OAB)","official":"Evaluation of a Non-Implanted Electrical Stimulation Device for Overactive Bladder (OAB) EVANESCE-II","summary":"A study to evaluate the safety and effectiveness of FemPulse System","conditions":["Overactive Bladder (OAB)"],"interventions":[{"type":"DEVICE","name":"Device Group"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Medication Group"}],"criteria":"Key Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Females, defined as a person with a uterus and cervix, ≥21 years old, with a diagnosis of OAB and symptoms for more than 6 months, as confirmed by a physician. OAB is defined by urinary urgency, usually with urinary frequency and nocturia, with or without urgency urinary incontinence with symptoms\n* Willing and able to comply with study required procedures and visits (e.g., maintaining consistent medication use, fluid intake, diary completion).\n\nKey Exclusion Criteria:\n\n* Systemic condition or disease that may interfere with study participation (e.g., current systemic infection, uncontrolled autoimmune disease, uncontrolled immunodeficiency disease, history of myocardial infarction, etc.) as determined by study investigator.\n* Not an appropriate study candidate as determined by investigator.","minAge":"21 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"FEMALE","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":151,"start":"2025-09-30","pcd":"2027-05-31","upd":"2026-07-13","sponsor":"FemPulse Corporation","areas":["other"],"central":["Monica Unger · 7275123718 · monica.unger@moxieclinical.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Cedars Sinai","city":"Beverly Hills","pr":"California","zip":"90211","s":"R","lat":34.0736,"lon":-118.4004,"c":"Arman Jordan · 310-248-6716 · arman.jordan@cshs.org"},{"f":"UCLA","city":"Los Angeles","pr":"California","zip":"90095","s":"R","lat":34.0522,"lon":-118.2437,"c":"Katie Levitt · (310) 794 - 6786 · KLevitt@mednet.ucla.edu"},{"f":"UC Irvine","city":"Orange